      "content": "milk to neutralize it? i've never heard of that but i guess i can try. the scratchy feeling in my throat is actually getting a little bit more intense now, like it's getting a bit harder to swallow clearly. it's making me feel a little nervous. if i take the single dose of benadryl like you said, and the scratchy feeling doesn't go away in like 20 minutes, can i just take another one then? i just really want to make sure this stops before it gets any worse so i don't end up needing a doctor.",
